IEA 15 MW OpenFAST reference deck (vendored subset)
====================================================

Source:  https://github.com/IEAWindSystems/IEA-15-240-RWT
Commit:  e4993d63de10f165389534461dd544006750fe60
License: Apache License 2.0 (see the upstream LICENSE file)

Files vendored (unchanged) from `OpenFAST/IEA-15-240-RWT` and
`OpenFAST/IEA-15-240-RWT-Monopile`:

  case/IEA-15-240-RWT_AeroDyn15.dat
      AeroDyn primary file, taken from the Monopile case.  It uses AeroDyn
      input version 15.03, which requires OpenFAST 4.x (the upstream CI pins
      `openfast<5.0`).
  IEA-15-240-RWT/IEA-15-240-RWT_AeroDyn15_blade.dat
      Blade distributed aerodynamic properties (BlSpn, BlChord, BlTwist,
      BlAFID; 50 nodes).
  IEA-15-240-RWT/Airfoils/IEA-15-240-RWT_AeroDyn15_Polar_*.dat
      50 AirfoilInfo polar tables (Alpha/Cl/Cd/Cm), one per blade node.

Purpose: the A1 BEM parity test (`tests/test_bem_openfast_parity.py`) builds
the AeroElast blade and the OpenFAST AeroDyn driver case from this single
source of truth, so both codes use identical geometry and identical polar
tables.  See `tests/_openfast_bem.py` for the parsing and the switch
overrides applied to the OpenFAST side.

